Z||000000||Zorba||10-06-2000||09:08 PM||||Does anyone know if these headers would fit a v8 conversion without hitting the passenger side axle? These are block huggers.<P>&lt;img src=http://images.honesty.com/cgi-bin/honesty-image/14450859/headers2.jpg"&gt;Huggers&lt;/a&gt;<BR> <A HREF="http://images.honesty.com/cgi-bin/honesty-image/14450859/headers2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://images.honesty.com/cgi-bin/honesty-image/14450859/headers2.jpg</A> <P>||||reg||5
Z||000001||Archie||10-06-2000||09:30 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Zorba:<BR><B>Does anyone know if these headers would fit a v8 conversion without hitting the passenger side axle?  <BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yes, someone knows.<P>Nope they won't fit, Also won't clear the alternator on the other side of the engine.<P>Archie||||reg||1
